# ICTRAX server/vhost directives that cannot be enforced from .htaccess.
# Place these in Apache's main server configuration (outside .htaccess), then
# run `httpd -t` and restart Apache. Do not paste them inside .htaccess.

TraceEnable Off
ServerTokens Prod
ServerSignature Off

# The ICTRAX document root still needs AllowOverride FileInfo AuthConfig Limit
# (or AllowOverride All) for the repository .htaccess controls to be active.
